WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:07.549
Well, we will get to Sixth
in 12 more jumps.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.260
It feels unusual
that the fleet isn't interfering,

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:11.553
even discouraging.

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:13.763
I bet they're busy
with what happened on Fifth.

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:18.226
I saw your personal data
when the fleet got you in custody.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:22.188
Sixth is your home planet, isn't it?
Is your body there as well?

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.733
-Nope.
-Then where is it?

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:28.737
It decomposed.
I was totally paralyzed after an accident.

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:32.157
They determined I was brain dead,
and I was gotten rid of on the spot.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.077
Then when did you use Mind Trance
to get into your current body?

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:38.997
What? Are you interested?

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:41.583
-Stop with this and just tell me.
-Okay, okay.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:44.627
The pilots of the Asteroid Speed race

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.755
copy their consciousness into the machine

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:49.549
and technically have two consciousnesses.

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:51.259
I'm the copy.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:55.764
Oh, so you're
an emergency backup data?

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:58.558
Did you not have a human body
from the start?

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.769
I'm like a ghost.

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:05.065
I am Rick Ayer
and at the same time I'm not.

00:01:05.607 --> 00:01:09.319
That's why your augmented reality avatar
isn't of flesh and blood.

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:12.739
This is my distinction.

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:16.201
Yeah, even if I'm like this, I still--

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:18.078
You still want to race?

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:19.954
And I still want to get with a woman.

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.290
Though you're a machine.

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:26.836
So, this is what you wanted to talk about
before we get to Sixth?

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:28.797
Tell me, Amanza...

00:01:29.798 --> 00:01:31.299
am I alive?

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.302
Or am I a product of imagination?

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:37.972
To say the least,

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.141
you are here.

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:42.268
I'm here, huh?

00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:44.771
That's a relief.

